sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Customer
    participant O as Order service
    participant L as Event log
    participant P as Product service
    participant Y as Payment service

    Note over C,Y: A definite no: the card is declined
    O->>Y: POST /charges
    Y-->>O: 402 payment-declined
    O->>L: append PaymentDeclined
    O->>P: DELETE /reservations/{id}
    O->>L: append StockReleased
    O-->>C: 402, status payment_failed

    Note over C,Y: No answer: nothing is known, so nothing is decided
    O->>Y: POST /charges
    Y--xO: no answer (provider down or slow)
    O-->>C: 202 Accepted, status awaiting_payment
    Note over O: the reconciler asks again, the Payment<br/>service returns its recorded answer
    O->>Y: POST /charges  (same order id)
    Y-->>O: 200 approved (the same charge)
    O->>L: append PaymentCaptured

    Note over C,Y: Nobody pays in time
    Note over O: awaiting_payment older than the limit
    O->>L: append ReservationExpired
    O->>Y: DELETE /charges/{id}
    Note over Y: void, or a tombstone so a charge<br/>still on its way can never succeed
    O->>P: DELETE /reservations/{id}
    O->>L: append StockReleased, PaymentRefunded
